1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:09,920
In a world that so often gives praise to those who haven't earned it, in a world that so often

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:16,260
actually cheers on those who cheat their way to the top versus work their way to the top,

3
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:24,060
in a society that loves to give participation awards as if everybody is giving the same amount

4
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:33,660
of effort, it behooves you to show love, appreciation, and acknowledgement to those who show love

5
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:39,400
and appreciation and acknowledgement of your talent, of your effort, and of your skill.

6
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:50,160
You can simultaneously know your worth, know your value, and your integrity, while also

7
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:58,180
giving reverence, admiration, and appreciation to those who bring those same things and

8
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:00,420
have been doing it longer than you.

